Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.87,0:21:56.00,Title,,0,0,0,,{\frz270\3c&HCBA6A9&\blur10\fad(441,0)\pos(660,500)}就是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.87,0:21:56.00,Title,,0,0,0,,{\frz270\3c&HCBA6A9&\blur10\fad(441,0)\pos(1088,368)}這樣也許
